4	// engines, builds a marker-trigger [qemu fast-leg -> verilator accurate-leg] plan
5	// on a fixture ELF, and runs it through run_plan -- spawning actual QEMU + vsim
6	// and threading the drained hybrid_state_v1 between them. It asserts the
7	// done-when: the plan succeeds and the vsim leg's mcycle exceeds the qemu leg's
8	// (vsim restores qemu's mcycle then counts real cycles, so the delta is the
9	// measured kernel's cycle count). There is no QEMU2 leg -- handback was removed.
10	//
